Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}He broke us mentally
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}with that mentality
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あいつはその考え方で
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺らを精神的にぶっ壊したんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}that you have to pick and choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}どっちかを選ばなきゃいけない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You can't be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}両方とは一緒にやれないってな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's why we have to do things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}to break that mentality
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だからそういう考え方を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ぶっ壊すことをやんなきゃいけねえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}to be like, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}"いいか？"って言えるようにな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:11.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We're embracing Jay-Z,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:11.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and we're embracing the NFL.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:11.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺らはJay-Zも受け入れるし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:11.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}NFLも受け入れる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}で、何か文句ある？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}'Cause it was some motherf**ker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}chasing me around all day yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}昨日なんか どっかのクソ野郎に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}一日中追い回されてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Little white dude with a little camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ちっちゃいカメラ持った 小柄な白人の男
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Hey, Snoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}"ヘイ、Snoop"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}What do you feel about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Jay-Z and the NFL thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}"Jay-ZとNFLの件 どう思います？"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:23.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:23.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}答えねえよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I showed up somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}で、別の場所に顔出したら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Here this ni**a come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}またこいつが来やがった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:27.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Hey, Snoop, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:27.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}"ヘイ、Snoop 調子どうです？"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}What do you feel about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Jay-Z and the NFL thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}"Jay-ZとNFLの件 どう思います？"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:32.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You ask me that one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:32.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}もう一回それ聞いてきたら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm gonna hit you in the head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}with a football.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}アメフトのボールで頭ぶん殴るぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:34.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}F**k out my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:34.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}とっとと失せろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}See, that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you need bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だからボディガードが必要なんだって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:40.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Well, Snoop,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:40.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}we appreciate you for coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:40.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Snoop、今日は来てくれてありがとう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:43.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and joining in on 67% of the…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}結構多いな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:44.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Somebody hit you with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:44.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}それ誰に吹き込まれた？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I just Googled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ググっただけだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That ain't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}それじゃ足りねえよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}S**t.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}クソッ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}If that was THC,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you'd be high as a motherf**ker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それがTHCだったら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}お前バチバチにキマってるぞ
